# The data directory is now a live SQLite database rather than a tree of
# markdown, and it holds your access tokens. Committing it would commit those,
# and a copy taken while the server is running is a torn write rather than a
# backup. Use `circe-server export` to get a directory worth committing, or
# connect a repository on the Settings page and push to it.
/data/

